    "v0.1.17": {
      "yanked": false,
      "notes": "AgentRT v0.1.17\n\n## 2. 平台支持\n\n- Linux（主力平台）：x86-64 / x86-32 / arm-64 / arm-32\n- macOS：arm-64（Apple Silicon）/ x86-64（Intel）\n- Windows：x86-64 / x86-32\n\n## 3. 安装\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.17/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nWindows（PowerShell）：\n```powershell\nirm https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.17/install.ps1 | iex\n```\n\n## 4. 本版变更\n\n* install: drop explanatory comments and refresh fallback version\n* gates: enforce cli command face and layer boundaries\n* cli: split session view, approval face and tui frontend\n* agentrt: update daemons submodule for mem_d statistics\n* cli: render mem and llm statistics field by field\n* atoms: update submodule for calibration observability\n* cli: unify turn usage accounting across every turn exit\n* agent_d: propagate subagent orchestration failures to callers\n* cli: surface cognition review failures instead of degrading silently\n* tool_d: drop the cross-session write gate and make service stats atomic\n* cli: route orchestration errors through unified descriptor\n* agentrt: adopt the canonical role vocabulary SSoT\n* agentrt: update daemons submodule for the tool-loop fuse\n* agentrt: update daemons submodule for the ledger integration\n* agentrt: update daemons submodule for the semantic cache chain\n* agentrt: update daemons submodule for outbound retry backoff\n* agentrt: update daemons and gateway submodules\n* agentrt: stop ignoring the leaf repositories\n* scripts: strip design-exposing comments and root-fix --help\n* airy/cli: make F8 retry the current GCCP question in both loops\n* airy/cli: map AIRY_ERR_GCCP_INTERACTION to a readable description\n* airy/cli: keep last board snapshot when gateway fetch fails\n* airy/cli: expose maths_eval, maths_stats and maths_plot schemas\n* airy/cli: align think render doc with deepseek-flash\n* install: stop rejecting a valid package on cross-version update\n* airy/cli: render a semantic failure as a failed task\n* airy/cli: back off dag_status polling to stop daemon flood\n* airy/cli: reserve review budget headroom for the daemon chain\n* airy/cli: probe gateway health with GET\n* airy/gccp: reject echoed question at the cli boundary",
